  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/505704/diamond-spheres-invention-and-ingenuity?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Invention &amp; Ingenuity</a></sup></p>\n<p><em>The sense of smell is a powerful yet fine-tuned sense, which can be tailored to allow for greater flexibility.</em></p>\n<p>Whenever you create an aroma, you can choose to have it only affect your allies, enemies, or a specific creature type of your choice (and subtype, if you choose a humanoid or outsider).</p>\n<p>Additionally, whenever you create an aroma that requires a Fortitude save, you can replace any Fortitude saves that it permits with a Will save. This makes such an aroma a mind-affecting effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
